sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Secrets resolve at startup, before application use
accDescr: ECS retrieves the secret with the execution role and injects it into a new container, which then connects to the managed database endpoint.
participant ECS as ECS task startup
participant SM as Secrets Manager
participant APP as Fargate container
participant DB as RDS SQL Server
ECS->>SM: Get secret using execution role
SM-->>ECS: Current credential value
ECS->>APP: Start with injected environment
APP->>DB: Connect through DB endpoint
Note over SM,APP: Later secret rotation does not alter this environment
Note over APP,DB: New tasks refresh credentials, reconnect after DB failover
